('6e7eae9a-4941-4b18-9bda-13548643aae3', NULL, 'WHATSAPP', 'OUTBOUND', NULL, NULL, 'SENT', 0, NULL, 'Dear Ms. Cathrina Manalo,\n\nWarm greetings from AAA Business Consultancy.\n\nThank you for taking the time to speak with us. It was a pleasure learning more about your plans to relocate to Spain through the Spain Digital Nomad Visa.\n\nAs discussed, the next step is our Professional Eligibility Assessment, which includes:\n\n✅ One-to-one consultation with a Senior Spain Visa & Residency Consultant\n✅ Detailed review of your profile and supporting documents\n✅ Assessment of your eligibility for the Spain Digital Nomad Visa\n✅ Identification of missing documents or potential risks\n✅ Personalised document checklist\n✅ Professional recommendations tailored to your case\n✅ Clear step-by-step action plan\n\nThe fee is €250. Should you proceed with our Full Processing Package or Premium Package within 14 days from the date of payment, the full €250 will be deducted from the selected package price.\n\nWe have sent you the invoice and bank payment details.\n\nYou may review our available service packages here:\n[https://aaabusinessconsultancy.com/services-and-packages/](https://aaabusinessconsultancy.com/services-and-packages/)\n\nOnce payment is received, our team will begin reviewing your documents and prepare your professional assessment and personalised recommendations.\n\nKind regards,\nWael Madi\nSenior Spain Visa & Residency Consultant\nAAA Business Consultancy L.L.C.\n\nBusinesses Can Be Copied. Trust Must Be Earned.', '2026-08-05 10:09:52.301', '2026-08-05 10:09:52.301', 'Agent', '+971524863758', '85419ace-6141-4c99-addc-267bb29b188a'),
