('8aeeb558-1fe0-4143-a8b8-03c8a25ae47b', NULL, 'WHATSAPP', 'OUTBOUND', 'SMaf997487a482ad1e3c1a7e7b9c54dd6c', NULL, 'SENT', 0, NULL, 'Greetings from *AAA Business Consultancy LLC*. Thank you for contacting us regarding Spain Visa & Residency Services.✈️✈️', '2026-08-20 13:20:08.060', '2026-08-20 13:20:08.060', 'Agent', '+966506093643', NULL),
('8aef98ea-3cbd-4b38-88c0-2a1c2afd7f6b', NULL, 'WHATSAPP', 'INBOUND', 'SMc2d19a017006a3829b6bdf69a3c44498', NULL, 'SENT', 1, NULL, 'I need a Spain Schengen tourist visa appointment in Dubai or Abu Dhabi before 15 September. I am a Palestinian passport holder and UAE resident. My husband will be my sponsor. How much is the appointment/service fee only, and is the appointment confirmed through BLS?', '2026-08-09 05:01:26.403', '2026-08-09 09:46:26.540', 'Dana', '+971564416838', NULL),
('8af37a15-614f-458e-8163-ae9e322c7d19', NULL, 'WHATSAPP', 'INBOUND', 'SMd50e08f33596bc08f98204f8ad115bc0', NULL, 'SENT', 1, NULL, 'Dear Sir/Madam,\n\nI hope you are doing well.\n\nI am writing to inquire about the Spain Self-Employed / Business Residency process for myself and my wife.\n\nI am currently living in the United Arab Emirates and have been involved in the mobile phone and electronics business in the UAE for approximately 15 years. I am interested in relocating to Spain and establishing or operating a small business there, preferably related to my existing business experience.\n\nMy wife is currently residing in Bangladesh, and my intention is for both of us to relocate to Spain legally and live there together.\n\nCould you please advise me on the following:\n\n* Whether I am eligible for the Spain Self-Employed / Business Residency route\n* Whether my wife can apply with me or join me as my dependent\n* The required investment or proof of funds\n* Documents required from both of us\n* Whether you can assist with the business plan and business setup in Spain\n* Your complete professional/service fees\n* Estimated government, legal, translation, and other charges\n* Approximate processing time\n* Whether the entire application can be handled while I am residing in the UAE\n* Whether you work with a licensed lawyer or authorized professional in Spain\n\nI would appreciate it if you could provide me with a complete breakdown of the process and total estimated cost for both myself and my wife before we proceed.\n\nI am looking for a legal and transparent process and would be happy to arrange a meeting at your Dubai office to discuss my case in detail.\n\nThank you, and I look forward to your response.\n\nKind regards,\nMohammed Romon Uddin\nUnited Arab Emirates', '2026-08-16 10:25:30.020', '2026-08-16 11:55:59.135', 'Mdromon', '+8801878191955', NULL),
