('94fa85c5-e6e3-4bf9-86b6-6a7c5f89d38a', NULL, 'WHATSAPP', 'OUTBOUND', NULL, NULL, 'FAILED', 0, 'The concatenated message body exceeds the 1600 character limit', 'Dear Aiza Balasta,\n\nThank you very much for taking the time to meet with us today. We truly appreciate the opportunity to speak with you and understand your concerns. We completely respect that choosing an immigration consultant is an important decision, and it is natural to be cautious.\n\nFirst and foremost, I would like to reassure you that AAA Business Consultancy L.L.C. is a legitimate and professionally licensed business consultancy company. We are not scammers.\n\nFor your peace of mind, you are welcome to verify our business credentials at any time:\n\n* We hold a valid UAE Trade License.\n* We are registered with a valid UAE Tax Registration Number (TRN).\n* We operate from a physical office in the UAE.\n* You can find our office on Google Maps.\n* We have a professional website outlining our services, terms and conditions, and refund policy.\n\nWe believe in complete transparency, which is why we clearly explain every service before any commitment is made.\n\nRegarding the Professional Case Assessment (€250), this is a separate professional service and is not simply a consultation fee. During this assessment, our specialists will:\n\n* Carefully review all of your documents.\n* Assess your eligibility for the most appropriate Spanish visa.\n* Analyze your individual circumstances.\n* Identify any missing or incorrect documents.\n* Provide you with a personalized checklist of all the documents required for your specific application.\n* Highlight any potential risks or weaknesses before you invest in a full application.\n\nThis assessment gives you a clear understanding of your case and allows you to make an informed decision before proceeding.\n\nIf, after receiving the assessment, you decide to continue with us, the €250 assessment fee will be deducted from the cost of our End-to-End Visa & Residency Package, so you will not pay for it twice.\n\nAfter the assessment, if you choose to proceed with our End-to-End Visa & Residency Package (€3,500), we will professionally manage your application from start to finish. Our service includes reviewing and preparing your documents, ensuring your application is fully compliant, submitting the application, communicating with the Spanish authorities when required, following up on your file, and supporting you until a final decision is issued.\n\nUnfortunately, many applicants choose providers based solely on the lowest price. In some cases, applications are submitted without a proper legal assessment or without ensuring that all the required documentation is complete. This can lead to delays, requests for additional documents, or even refusal of the application. Our goal is to avoid those risks by preparing your case professionally from the very beginning.\n\nIn addition, our End-to-End Package is backed by our refund policy. If, despite following our professional guidance, the application is refused, we provide a 100% refund of our professional service fees, in accordance with our Terms and Conditions. The only non-refundable costs are:\n\n* Spanish Government application fees (Tasa).\n* Sworn translation fees.\n\nThese costs cannot be refunded because they are paid directly to the relevant government authorities and certified sworn translators, not retained by our company.\n\nWe hope this explanation gives you confidence in who we are and how we work. Our objective is not simply to submit visa applications—it is to provide honest professional advice, protect our clients from unnecessary risks, and guide them throughout the entire immigration process with complete transparency.\n\nWe would be delighted to assist you with your Professional Case Assessment and answer any further questions you may have. We sincerely hope to have the opportunity to earn your trust and work with you.\n\nThank you once again for your time and consideration. We look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-08-03 08:52:52.822', '2026-08-03 08:52:52.822', 'Agent', '+971545333511', NULL),
