('d9d3c708-fdd6-4bcf-9dc6-2db0cd679205', NULL, 'WHATSAPP', 'OUTBOUND', NULL, NULL, 'FAILED', 0, 'The concatenated message body exceeds the 1600 character limit', 'Dear Client,\nThank you for your interest in Spain visa and residency options and for registering for our Free Eligibility Assessment.\nAs you were unable to attend the scheduled Eligibility Assessment, we are unable to arrange another Assessment. However, we would be pleased to assist you through our Professional Case Assessment, which includes a detailed one-to-one review of your profile with one of our senior specialist consultants.\nProfessional Case Assessment Fee\nAssessment Fee: €250\nDuring the Professional Case Assessment, you will receive:\nA dedicated one-to-one consultation with a senior specialist consultant\nA professional evaluation of your eligibility\nA detailed review of your personal and professional circumstances\nA recommendation regarding the most suitable Spain visa or residency pathway\nA personalised document checklist\nConfirmation of the mandatory documents required\nIdentification of any missing or additional supporting documents\nGuidance regarding document legalisation and Spanish sworn translation\nAn application-readiness assessment\nA personalised action plan\nAn estimated timeline based on your individual circumstances\nPlease note that the Professional Case Assessment is a standalone advisory service and does not include application preparation, submission, appointment booking, or end-to-end processing.\nIf you proceed with one of our Residency Full Processing Package  or Premium Full Package within 14 days of receiving the payment, the assessment fee will be deducted from the applicable package fee, subject to our terms and conditions.\nPlease reply to this message / email if you would like to proceed, and our team will send you the invoice secure payment link and the next steps.\nKind regards,\nCustomer Support Team\nAAA Business Consultancy L.L.C.\nBusinesses can be copied. Trust must be earned.', '2026-08-05 10:18:59.860', '2026-08-05 10:18:59.860', 'Agent', '+971547056395', '85419ace-6141-4c99-addc-267bb29b188a'),
