('ee7f2497-92e3-47fa-8edc-f47e70e010f5', NULL, 'WHATSAPP', 'INBOUND', 'SMab1ceb6f292376a7cceec211cf197a28', NULL, 'SENT', 1, NULL, 'Hello, I would like to book an appointment for my son to submit and A To submit his documents to the Spanish embassy for a visa, noting that he has a one-year university acceptance letter from Spain... Is it possible to schedule an appointment to complete the application process?', '2026-08-01 12:06:29.330', '2026-08-01 13:19:41.249', 'كابتن وليد', '+971504345256', NULL),
('eea54345-fd14-4df6-9ea8-6527117e0a45', NULL, 'WHATSAPP', 'INBOUND', 'SMd95fdd6c51d2aabdf8baa353b4fcc04c', NULL, 'SENT', 1, NULL, 'Hello, I would like to know if you can help me obtain a legal Spain work/residence permit.\n\nI am a Bangladeshi passport holder currently living and working in the UAE, and I have a valid UAE residence visa.\n\nMy work experience includes:\n• AC Maintenance Helper – currently working in the UAE\n• Storekeeper – 1 year experience in the UAE\n• Mobile shop and clothing shop experience\n\nI am interested in working legally in Spain. I am open to different jobs, including:\n• Housekeeping\n• Cleaner\n• Office Boy / Office Assistant\n• Hotel/Restaurant Helper\n• General Helper\n• AC Maintenance Helper\n• Warehouse/Store Helper\n\nI am willing to work in any suitable position for which I can legally obtain a Spanish work permit.\n\nCould you please tell me:\n\n1. Which Spain work visa/residence route is suitable for my profile?\n2. Can you arrange a genuine job offer from a Spanish employer?\n3. Will the Spanish employer apply for my work authorization?\n4. Can I see the employer details and job contract before making the main payment?\n5. What is the total consultancy fee in AED?\n6. What government/visa fees are separate from your service fee?\n7. If the work permit or visa is refused, what amount is refundable?\n8. Approximately how long does the complete process take?\n\nI am looking for a genuine and legal employment route, not a tourist visa or any illegal work arrangement.\n\nThank you. I would appreciate a clear explanation of the process and total cost.', '2026-08-12 07:33:27.989', '2026-08-12 08:19:16.398', 'Ahmed Shakil', '+971545070142', NULL),
('eeb38b03-a474-4ba9-9a37-0a12502719e4', NULL, 'WHATSAPP', 'OUTBOUND', 'SM0a6b3b6301aa71cbff672c74011f6985', NULL, 'SENT', 0, NULL, '❌ *Spain Visa Consultation Cancelled*\n\nDear *Hamza  Test*,\n\nYour Spain Visa Eligibility Assessment scheduled for 22/08/2026 at 10:30 AM – 10:50 AM (UAE) has been cancelled as requested.\n\nIf you ever wish to re-book, feel free to visit our booking page anytime:\nhttps://aaa-crm-service.netlify.app/#/public/lead-form?leadId=46be12c5-a628-42b4-8712-71992f3462b7&rebook=true', '2026-08-20 13:32:18.633', '2026-08-20 13:32:18.633', 'Agent', '+971527878451', NULL),
